# Review hygiene for third-party code (see `docs/extracting-binaries.md`, "Upstream sources").
#
# `linguist-generated` collapses a path's diff in GitHub pull requests by default;
# `linguist-vendored` excludes it from language statistics and code search.

third_party/** linguist-vendored=true
**/vendor/** linguist-vendored=true

# Lockfiles (their integrity is checked by Cargo against the `checksum` fields).
Cargo.lock linguist-generated=true
**/Cargo.lock linguist-generated=true
